%% M9 sequence: a customer downloads a PDF receipt.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant W as Next.js BFF
    participant G as api-gateway
    participant PS as parcel-service
    participant DB as parcels_db
    C->>W: click PDF receipt on the history page
    W->>G: GET /api/v1/parcels/{id}/receipt (bearer JWT)
    G->>PS: forward (JWT valid)
    PS->>DB: load the parcel, fee lines and history
    DB-->>PS: parcel
    alt not the owner and not staff
        PS-->>W: 403 problem+json
    else owner or staff
        PS->>PS: ReceiptPdfGenerator renders with OpenPDF
        PS-->>W: 200 application/pdf
        W-->>C: receipt opens or downloads
    end
